      "Jurors are 2B to 4B parameter models. They make mistakes the majority only partly averages out; 0.81 is not 0.95.",
      "Fleiss kappa is only moderate (about 0.4). Jurors often disagree, so a single borderline item can flip on one vote.",
      "Excluding the generator's family leaves 4 voters (a spare replaces it only if one of an unused family exists). A 2-2 split is not a majority, so the item passes.",
